WEBVTT

1
01:10:14.178 --> 01:10:16.878
Lastly, we will stretch our hands once more towards these families.

2
01:10:16.878 --> 01:10:21.878
Lastly, I want to pronounce a blessing over the families in the name of Jesus.

3
01:10:21.878 --> 01:10:26.878
That the families will be blessed with protection in the kingdom of God.

4
01:10:26.878 --> 01:10:30.878
That this society will not rob them of the love of Jesus.

5
01:10:30.878 --> 01:10:33.878
But that the blood of Jesus will be upon them.

6
01:10:33.878 --> 01:10:38.878
So that whatever comes through the families, in elementary schools, in high schools ultimately.

7
01:10:38.878 --> 01:10:43.878
That the philosophies of this world may not run through the families.

8
01:10:43.878 --> 01:10:46.878
And that the families will stay together in the name of Jesus.

9
01:10:46.878 --> 01:10:50.878
We pray together for unity in the name of Jesus.

10
01:10:50.878 --> 01:10:54.878
We pray for the kingdom of God in the name of Jesus over the families.

11
01:10:54.878 --> 01:10:58.878
We pray for unity in the couples in the name of Jesus.

12
01:10:58.878 --> 01:11:03.878
That there will also be unity regarding parenting.

13
01:11:03.878 --> 01:11:06.878
Unity in the name of Jesus.

14
01:11:06.878 --> 01:11:11.878
So that the enemy may not rob the children in the name of Jesus.

15
01:11:11.878 --> 01:11:15.878
And we all say amen. Amen and amen.

16
01:11:15.878 --> 01:11:18.878
Praise the name of Jesus.

17
01:11:18.878 --> 01:11:20.878
Hallelujah.

18
01:11:22.878 --> 01:11:28.878
You may come off this side of the stage and there we have beautiful gifts.

19
01:11:31.878 --> 01:11:33.878
Hallelujah.

20
01:11:34.878 --> 01:11:37.878
Praise God. Amen.

21
01:11:37.878 --> 01:11:39.878
That is wonderful, isn't it?

22
01:11:39.878 --> 01:11:41.878
God's kingdom.

23
01:11:41.878 --> 01:11:43.878
Hallelujah.

24
01:11:46.878 --> 01:11:50.878
Robert, you are already here. Stay here for a moment.

25
01:11:50.878 --> 01:11:53.878
Can you do the collection right away?

26
01:11:53.878 --> 01:12:03.878
The collection text can be displayed on the screen.

27
01:12:06.878 --> 01:12:10.878
The people who, the pastor, this is about them.

28
01:12:10.878 --> 01:12:14.878
The people who help the pastor in leading the congregation.

29
01:12:14.878 --> 01:12:17.878
Must be good and decent people.

30
01:12:17.878 --> 01:12:23.878
They must be honest in everything, not drink too much wine, and not be greedy.

31
01:12:23.878 --> 01:12:29.878
But they must hold firmly to the mystery of the faith with a clear conscience.

32
01:12:29.878 --> 01:12:36.878
It must first be determined whether they are suitable for their task.

33
01:12:36.878 --> 01:12:41.878
Only if it turns out that they are suitable, may they begin.

34
01:12:41.878 --> 01:12:45.878
Their wives must also be decent in everything.

35
01:12:45.878 --> 01:12:50.878
They must not gossip. Just a moment about gossip.

36
01:12:52.878 --> 01:12:58.878
Yes, but you see it so much. People who speak so poorly of each other, don't do that.

37
01:12:58.878 --> 01:13:04.878
We are called as Christians, as His children, as His ambassadors to encourage one another.

38
01:13:04.878 --> 01:13:10.878
To help each other, to build up, to show the way, to bless, to pray for one another.

39
01:13:10.878 --> 01:13:12.878
Do not gossip, bless.

40
01:13:13.878 --> 01:13:18.878
But they must be sober and trustworthy in everything.

41
01:13:18.878 --> 01:13:23.878
The men who help the leader of the congregation may have only one wife.

42
01:13:23.878 --> 01:13:30.878
And they must be able to lead their own family well and the other people in their household.

43
01:13:30.878 --> 01:13:34.878
If they do their job well, people will have respect for them.

44
01:13:34.878 --> 01:13:41.878
And they will be trusted and able to speak without fear about the faith in Jesus Christ.

45
01:13:41.878 --> 01:13:47.878
That is a clear text. We take this text seriously as a congregation.

46
01:13:47.878 --> 01:13:53.878
We set, or I say we, but I am not even in the leadership in that regard.

47
01:13:53.878 --> 01:13:58.878
Tim and Vanessa do not just appoint anyone to leadership.

48
01:13:58.878 --> 01:14:03.878
It also states here. A leader must be completely trustworthy.

49
01:14:03.878 --> 01:14:10.878
A leader must have proven himself for many years to be faithful to God, to be faithful to the church.

50
01:14:10.878 --> 01:14:15.878
That he does not prioritize his own life, but the gospel of Jesus.

51
01:14:15.878 --> 01:14:23.878
So Tim and Vanessa take this very seriously and seek God earnestly in this.

52
01:14:23.878 --> 01:14:25.878
Who do I appoint?

53
01:14:25.878 --> 01:14:30.878
And that is important, because the congregation must be a safe place.

54
01:14:30.878 --> 01:14:35.878
Tim has already talked a lot about this in recent months.

55
01:14:35.878 --> 01:14:39.878
And if something goes wrong once in a while.

56
01:14:39.878 --> 01:14:42.878
There are all kinds of people and things happen.

57
01:14:42.878 --> 01:14:45.878
But then we also handle it with great integrity.

58
01:14:45.878 --> 01:14:48.878
And we do not cover it up.

59
01:14:48.878 --> 01:14:55.878
I want to talk to you today about how the finances in the church work.

60
01:14:55.878 --> 01:14:59.878
A lot of money comes in, as Bram showed again last week.

61
01:14:59.878 --> 01:15:05.878
It is amazing how God can establish something so special with so few people.

62
01:15:05.878 --> 01:15:08.878
It shows how much He loves the Kempen.

63
01:15:08.878 --> 01:15:15.878
How much He has in mind to save and bless you, me, and the people around us.

64
01:15:15.878 --> 01:15:19.878
That is why the congregation is being built, that is why we are here working.

65
01:15:21.878 --> 01:15:24.878
We have a pastor, Tim and Vanessa.

66
01:15:24.878 --> 01:15:27.878
We have elders, Bram and Els.

67
01:15:27.878 --> 01:15:30.878
We have a board with five people in it.

68
01:15:30.878 --> 01:15:35.878
They help to keep everything on track.

69
01:15:35.878 --> 01:15:39.878
And these are all people who are reliable.

70
01:15:39.878 --> 01:15:43.878
People we didn't just pick out like, oh, that's a nice guy.

71
01:15:43.878 --> 01:15:45.878
Let's make him a leader.

72
01:15:45.878 --> 01:15:48.878
Or he has a talent.

73
01:15:48.878 --> 01:15:52.878
Or he can do that very well, let's put him in a leadership role.

74
01:15:52.878 --> 01:15:55.878
No, God builds His congregation.

75
01:15:55.878 --> 01:15:57.878
God appoints people.

76
01:15:57.878 --> 01:16:03.878
And for that, as we just read, it is necessary that you ensure you are reliable.

77
01:16:03.878 --> 01:16:08.878
If you want to be a leader, everyone is a leader, it is not necessary at all.

78
01:16:08.878 --> 01:16:10.878
But everyone is important.

79
01:16:10.878 --> 01:16:13.878
Everyone has a place in the house of God.

80
01:16:13.878 --> 01:16:16.878
But if you aspire to become a leader, that is perfectly fine.

81
01:16:16.878 --> 01:16:19.878
But make sure you are faithful.

82
01:16:19.878 --> 01:16:22.878
That you root yourself in the congregation, that you participate.

83
01:16:22.878 --> 01:16:26.878
That you show God and your pastor who you are.

84
01:16:26.878 --> 01:16:29.878
That you want to live for Jesus.

85
01:16:29.878 --> 01:16:34.878
In that administration, or in the church, a lot of money comes in.

86
01:16:34.878 --> 01:16:37.878
And we handle that very carefully.

87
01:16:37.878 --> 01:16:39.878
We don't just participate casually.

88
01:16:39.878 --> 01:16:41.878
We have more than twenty teams in the church.

89
01:16:41.878 --> 01:16:49.878
Those teams make a detailed plan every year of what they want to do in the coming year.

90
01:16:49.878 --> 01:16:51.878
Budgets are determined.

91
01:16:51.878 --> 01:16:55.878
So not just throughout the year, that can be fun once in a while.

92
01:16:55.878 --> 01:16:58.878
Let's spend money on that or let's do that.

93
01:16:58.878 --> 01:17:01.878
No, because it is God's money.

94
01:17:01.878 --> 01:17:03.878
And it is important.

95
01:17:03.878 --> 01:17:07.878
So every year, careful planning is done.

96
01:17:07.878 --> 01:17:09.878
We have a financial administration.

97
01:17:09.878 --> 01:17:13.878
Bram is the treasurer of the congregation.

98
01:17:13.878 --> 01:17:18.878
Debby and Radovan help with the bookkeeping and the accountant.

99
01:17:18.878 --> 01:17:20.878
We also have an accountant.

100
01:17:20.878 --> 01:17:26.878
We are an officially recognized institution for general benefit.

101
01:17:26.878 --> 01:17:28.878
Ambi, abbreviated.

102
01:17:28.878 --> 01:17:31.878
Recognized by the government.

103
01:17:31.878 --> 01:17:35.878
In this, we must also comply with various rules.

104
01:17:35.878 --> 01:17:38.878
We adhere to them properly.

105
01:17:38.878 --> 01:17:40.878
We do not spend our money carelessly.

106
01:17:40.878 --> 01:17:46.878
Every euro, literally, we handle seriously.

107
01:17:46.878 --> 01:17:49.878
Because it is for God and for His purpose.

108
01:17:49.878 --> 01:17:53.878
Our pastors receive a salary, Tim and Vanessa.

109
01:17:53.878 --> 01:17:57.878
Not just something we thought would be nice.

110
01:17:57.878 --> 01:18:02.878
No, there is a national standard from the Protestant churches.

111
01:18:02.878 --> 01:18:06.878
In which all Protestant churches have agreed with each other.

112
01:18:06.878 --> 01:18:09.878
What is a fair salary for pastors?

113
01:18:09.878 --> 01:18:12.878
A national standard has been established for this.

114
01:18:12.878 --> 01:18:17.878
What Tim and Vanessa receive is a proper salary.

115
01:18:17.878 --> 01:18:20.878
But they do not receive more and they do not receive less.

116
01:18:20.878 --> 01:18:24.878
We have two more people who work one day a week for the church.

117
01:18:24.878 --> 01:18:26.878
Those are Sjaan and Roland.

118
01:18:26.878 --> 01:18:28.878
They are compensated for that one day.

119
01:18:28.878 --> 01:18:35.878
And for the rest, all money goes into the building, into the functioning of the church.

120
01:18:35.878 --> 01:18:39.878
I want to say with this, we do not just do anything.

121
01:18:39.878 --> 01:18:43.878
As this text indicates, leadership must be done well.

122
01:18:43.878 --> 01:18:48.878
So you can trust that if you invest your money in God's kingdom...

123
01:18:48.878 --> 01:18:54.878
through this congregation, it will be used to build God's kingdom.

124
01:18:55.878 --> 01:18:58.878
Tim just said, what you sow you will reap.

125
01:19:00.878 --> 01:19:04.878
If you sow in your own life, then it may go well with you.

126
01:19:04.878 --> 01:19:08.878
To a certain extent, because how far can you get with money?

127
01:19:09.878 --> 01:19:12.878
If you sow in God's kingdom...

128
01:19:12.878 --> 01:19:16.878
Tim said, what you sow you will reap.

129
01:19:16.878 --> 01:19:19.878
There is always fruit from where you sow.

130
01:19:19.878 --> 01:19:22.878
If you sow in your own life, it remains limited...

131
01:19:22.878 --> 01:19:25.878
to what you can personally benefit from it.

132
01:19:25.878 --> 01:19:28.878
Or maybe a few people around you.

133
01:19:28.878 --> 01:19:32.878
If you sow in the congregation, if you sow in God's kingdom...

134
01:19:32.878 --> 01:19:34.878
then you are sowing into generations.

135
01:19:34.878 --> 01:19:39.878
Then you are sowing in this congregation, in this building, in everything we are doing.

136
01:19:39.878 --> 01:19:45.878
In the future that we are working on with the new children's church and the new hall.

137
01:19:47.878 --> 01:19:50.878
How beautiful it is when you can stand before God later.

138
01:19:50.878 --> 01:19:53.878
And you can say, this is not just about money...

139
01:19:53.878 --> 01:19:56.878
but this is about your whole life with God.

140
01:19:56.878 --> 01:20:00.878
That God will say to you, well done, you have worked well for me.

141
01:20:00.878 --> 01:20:03.878
You have invested your money, you have invested your time well for me.

142
01:20:03.878 --> 01:20:05.878
You are welcome with me.

143
01:20:05.878 --> 01:20:09.878
And when you look around in heaven and you see people...

144
01:20:09.878 --> 01:20:13.878
who, because of your efforts, will be with Him forever.

145
01:20:13.878 --> 01:20:15.878
Is that not worth everything?

146
01:20:15.878 --> 01:20:17.878
Crooked, crooked, crooked.

147
01:20:17.878 --> 01:20:21.878
Not for us, but for God's kingdom.

148
01:20:34.878 --> 01:20:38.878
I don't want to keep asking to the point of annoyance if we could stand up.

149
01:20:38.878 --> 01:20:40.878
But can we please stand up?

150
01:20:40.878 --> 01:20:43.878
Because we are now approaching the Word of God.

151
01:20:43.878 --> 01:20:47.878
Are you ready for the Word of God? Do you have your Bible ready?

152
01:20:47.878 --> 01:20:48.878
Praise God.

153
01:20:48.878 --> 01:20:54.878
Last week I started the study of the book of Acts.

154
01:20:54.878 --> 01:21:01.878
And in Acts, chapter 1, we read that Jesus continued to reveal Himself for 40 days.

155
01:21:02.878 --> 01:21:07.878
And He was with His disciples to talk about the kingdom of God.

156
01:21:07.878 --> 01:21:12.878
And Vanessa will elaborate on the kingdom of God here.

157
01:21:13.878 --> 01:21:16.878
Praise God. Are you ready for it?

158
01:21:18.878 --> 01:21:19.878
Thank you.

159
01:21:20.878 --> 01:21:23.878
Let us pray. Thank you, Lord, for your kingdom.

160
01:21:26.878 --> 01:21:28.878
You are the King of the kingdom.

161
01:21:28.878 --> 01:21:30.878
You are the King of the kingdom.

162
01:21:31.878 --> 01:21:33.878
Without a King, there is no King.

163
01:21:35.878 --> 01:21:37.878
Lord, you are the King.

164
01:21:37.878 --> 01:21:38.878
You are everything.

165
01:21:40.878 --> 01:21:42.878
And we worship you this morning.

166
01:21:45.878 --> 01:21:48.878
This is why we have come. We have come to worship you.

167
01:21:50.878 --> 01:21:53.878
We have come to hear from your Word.

168
01:21:53.878 --> 01:21:55.878
We need your Word.

169
01:21:55.878 --> 01:21:58.878
We need it to transform us.

170
01:22:02.878 --> 01:22:05.878
And to change us into being like you.

171
01:22:08.878 --> 01:22:10.878
This is your goal with every soul.

172
01:22:11.878 --> 01:22:12.878
It's that simple.

173
01:22:14.878 --> 01:22:16.878
You want us to be like you.

174
01:22:18.878 --> 01:22:20.878
So Lord, make us more like the Lord.

175
01:22:22.878 --> 01:22:24.878
Prepare us for the kingdom.

176
01:22:26.878 --> 01:22:28.878
In your name and for your glory.

177
01:22:33.878 --> 01:22:36.878
For your glory, Lord, for the sake of your name.

178
01:22:37.878 --> 01:22:38.878
Amen.

179
01:22:40.878 --> 01:22:41.878
Let's sit down.

180
01:22:51.878 --> 01:22:53.878
We are in 40 days of the kingdom.

181
01:22:56.878 --> 01:22:59.878
We are on day 21, where Jesus is after the resurrection of the dead.

182
01:23:00.878 --> 01:23:01.878
Amen.

183
01:23:04.878 --> 01:23:07.878
We are on day 21, where Jesus is after the resurrection of the dead.

184
01:23:08.878 --> 01:23:09.878
What was that Bart?

185
01:23:10.878 --> 01:23:11.878
What was that?

186
01:23:12.878 --> 01:23:13.878
Secret.

187
01:23:14.878 --> 01:23:15.878
Okay, I saw it.

188
01:23:16.878 --> 01:23:19.878
But it is 21 days after the resurrection of the dead.

189
01:23:20.878 --> 01:23:23.878
Who remembers the resurrection of the dead?

190
01:23:24.878 --> 01:23:25.878
We are already three weeks further.

191
01:23:26.878 --> 01:23:27.878
That is how fast life goes.

192
01:23:28.878 --> 01:23:29.878
Hallelujah.

193
01:23:30.878 --> 01:23:31.878
We are already three weeks further.

194
01:23:32.878 --> 01:23:33.878
It doesn't go that fast.

195
01:23:34.878 --> 01:23:36.878
And Jesus is still walking around on the planet.

196
