That is part of the gospel.

197
01:23:40.878 --> 01:23:41.878
Do you believe that?

198
01:23:48.878 --> 01:23:51.878
Paul writes that he was still seen by 500 different people.

199
01:23:53.878 --> 01:23:55.878
This is the gospel that you believe.

200
01:23:56.878 --> 01:23:57.878
Do you believe that?

201
01:24:11.878 --> 01:24:14.878
He has risen and he went around for another 40 days.

202
01:24:15.878 --> 01:24:19.878
And in those 40 days he showed his disciples convincing proof that he truly lived.

203
01:24:20.878 --> 01:24:21.878
And what did he do then?

204
