Thomas was a doubter.

208
01:24:38.878 --> 01:24:40.878
And Thomas said, I do not believe it until I see it myself.

209
01:24:50.878 --> 01:24:56.878
Our gracious Lord enters a gathering one day.

210
01:24:59.878 --> 01:25:03.878
At this moment, he goes through walls and doors.

211
01:25:05.878 --> 01:25:07.878
For he is in a glorified state.

212
01:25:12.878 --> 01:25:14.878
And Thomas says, I do not believe it until I see it myself.

213
01:25:15.878 --> 01:25:17.878
And so Jesus says, here Thomas, look, here I am.

214
01:25:22.878 --> 01:25:24.878
This is where the nails went through my skin.

215
01:25:29.878 --> 01:25:30.878
This is where I was wounded.

216
01:25:32.878 --> 01:25:33.878
He says, touch then.

217
01:25:33.878 --> 01:25:35.878
And then Thomas says, my Lord and my God, you are who you say you are.

218
01:25:43.878 --> 01:25:48.878
And then Jesus says to Thomas, you are blessed because you have seen me and believed.

219
01:25:48.878 --> 01:25:51.878
And how much more will those be blessed who have not seen me and have believed.

220
01:25:54.878 --> 01:25:58.878
And then Jesus says to Thomas, you are blessed because you have seen me and believed.

221
01:25:59.878 --> 01:26:03.878
And how much more will those be blessed who have not seen me and yet believe.

222
01:26:05.878 --> 01:26:06.878
And that is about you and me.

223
01:26:06.878 --> 01:26:09.878
We can feel the presence of the risen Lord, but with our natural eyes we do not all see the Lord in this life.

224
01:26:09.878 --> 01:26:10.878
We can feel the presence of the risen Lord, but with our natural eyes we do not all see the Lord in this life.

225
01:26:10.878 --> 01:26:17.078
But He goes around, warning that He is enthroned.

226
01:26:17.078 --> 01:26:28.078
We can feel the presence of the risen Lord, but with our natural eyes we do not all see the Lord in this life.

227
01:26:28.078 --> 01:26:40.078
We can feel the presence of the risen Lord, but with our natural eyes we do not all see the Lord in this life.

228
01:26:40.078 --> 01:26:42.878
But He goes around and He proves that He lives.

229
01:26:44.878 --> 01:26:46.878
And this has happened in history.

230
01:26:48.878 --> 01:26:50.878
It is a historical account.

231
01:26:55.878 --> 01:26:57.878
It is recorded in history.

232
01:27:02.878 --> 01:27:07.878
And Tim started in Acts 1 and I want to pause for a moment at that kingdom.

233
01:27:10.878 --> 01:27:13.878
You cannot teach the kingdom in 30 minutes.

234
01:27:17.878 --> 01:27:20.878
The kingdom is everything, that is where He has brought us.

235
01:27:22.878 --> 01:27:25.878
The cross leads to the kingdom.

236
01:27:30.878 --> 01:27:34.878
So many people are saved and then do not know what the purpose is afterwards.

237
01:27:35.678 --> 01:27:38.678
You are saved out of something and into something.

238
01:27:48.678 --> 01:27:54.678
You are saved from the world, from death, from a life full of sins and into the kingdom.

239
01:27:57.678 --> 01:28:00.678
So if you are saved, then that should be your focus.

240
01:28:01.478 --> 01:28:06.478
Learn as much as possible about the kingdom that is coming.

241
01:28:11.478 --> 01:28:14.478
For if you do not do that, then you will be a wobbly sheep.

242
01:28:22.478 --> 01:28:27.478
Then you are all over the place, you do not know exactly why you do or do not do what you want or do not want to do.

243
01:28:28.278 --> 01:28:34.278
You cannot afford to be a empty-headed Christian.

244
01:28:36.278 --> 01:28:37.278
You must be filled.

245
01:28:38.278 --> 01:28:40.278
You must be filled with His Word.

